1
00:00:00,069 --> 00:00:01,649
(Leonard:)She's extremely intelligent.

2
00:00:01,821 --> 00:00:04,701
SHELDON: She's not that intelligent.
LEONARD: She fixed your equation.

3
00:00:04,866 --> 00:00:07,156
SHELDON: She got lucky.
LEONARD: You don't believe in luck.

4
00:00:07,327 --> 00:00:09,827
(Sheldon:)I don't have to believe in it
for her to be lucky.

5
00:00:10,413 --> 00:00:13,333
(Leonard:)Regardless, I have a chance
at a real relationship with Leslie.

6
00:00:13,499 --> 00:00:16,669
I'm not gonna pass that up for
some hypothetical future happiness...

7
00:00:16,836 --> 00:00:19,836
(Leonard:)...with a woman who may
or may not want me to be happy...

8
00:00:20,006 --> 00:00:23,426
...with the woman
who is currently making me happy.

9
00:00:24,135 --> 00:00:25,345
SHELDON: Leonard.
LEONARD: Yeah?

10
00:00:25,511 --> 00:00:27,721
SHELDON:
I still don't care.

11
00:00:35,855 --> 00:00:37,185
Hey, Leslie.

12
00:00:37,357 --> 00:00:40,817
Careful, Leonard. Liquid nitrogen,
320 degrees below zero.

13
00:00:41,861 --> 00:00:43,951
Brrrr. Heh.

14
00:00:49,452 --> 00:00:51,992
(Leonard:)Why are you smashing
a flash-frozen banana?

15
00:00:52,163 --> 00:00:57,023
Because I got a bowl of Cheerios
and I couldn't find a knife.

